{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Golden Spur is a ",["l","饰品","trinket"]," item obtainable after claiming ",["l","精通山洞#Masteries","Combat Mastery"],". It can be obtained by slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"]," or breaking ",["l","矿井#Crates and Barrels","crates and barrels"]," in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", or ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"],". Drop chances from both methods are affected by ",["l","运气#Daily Luck","daily luck"]," and ",["l","运气#Luck Buffs","luck buffs"],", among other factors. The ",["l","窃贼戒指","Burglar's Ring"]," and ",["l","怪物图鉴","Monster Compendium"]," do not impact the chance to obtain it from monsters. There is also a ≈0.6% chance to obtain a Golden Spur from a ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure chest"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],"."]],["p",["While the Golden Spur is equipped in the trinket slot, the player gains a brief ",["l","速度","Speed (+1)"]," buff each time they land a ",["l","暴击力量","critical strike"],". The duration of the speed boost ranges from 5 to 10 seconds, and this time is determined to the second. Each of the six possible values is equally likely when it is dropped, and the duration can be changed if the trinket is re-forged on an ",["l","铁砧","Anvil"],"."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","法师","Wizard"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"]]]]]]],["Trivia",2,[["l",0,[[1,["It was likely intended to be called the Iridium Spur."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}